IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTI-LORA-HTORUS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-ADAPTERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TORUS-RINGS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HARDWARE-PORTS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-HTORUS-MESH.
    IF NUM-ADAPTERS == 0 OR TORUS-RINGS == 0 OR HARDWARE-PORTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 124200 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-ADAPTERS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
